{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "TKCreazy Seedance v1 视频接口补充（网关实测版）",
    "version": "2026-08-03-tested",
    "description": "这是可直接导入 Apifox 的 Seedance v1 视频接口补充文档。本文档只写已经通过 TKCreazy 网关端到端测试过的能力：上传参考图片、上传参考音频、单图生成、多图生成、图片+音频引用生成、查询任务、下载 MP4。所有示例均以 https://tkcreazy.top/v1 为调用入口；不要把模型平台内部地址、内部账号、内部密钥或存储签名地址写入用户文档。\n\n实测口径：2026-08-02/2026-08-03 使用本站网关创建本地测试账号、绑定视频生成分组和 API Key 后完成 E2E 测试；不是绕过网关直连模型平台测试。实测请求使用 model=seedance-2.0-fast、resolution=480p、duration=5、aspect_ratio=1:1。单图、多图、图片+音频三类任务均完成，任务 content 均可下载为 video/mp4；音频引用结果包含真实音轨，且主频与参考音频一致。\n\n保守原则：本文档不包含未在本轮通过网关测过的 video_reference_base、任务列表、删除任务、JSON/Base64 素材上传、1080p 或其它模型组合。需要公开这些能力时，应先通过 TKCreazy 网关重新 E2E 测试，再另行补充文档。"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://tkcreazy.top/v1",
      "description": "TKCreazy 公开网关"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Seedance 视频生成（已测）",
      "description": "只包含已通过 TKCreazy 网关端到端验证的 Seedance v1 视频生成接口。"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/videos/uploads": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Seedance 视频生成（已测）"
        ],
        "summary": "上传 Seedance 参考素材（已测：图片、音频）",
        "description": "上传后返回 media_url。后续创建视频时，把 media_url 原样填入 image_url、guidances.image_reference[].image.url 或 guidances.audio_reference[].audio.url。\n\n已通过网关测试的上传类型：image/png、image/jpeg、audio/wav。本文档暂不写 video 字段，因为本轮未对视频参考素材做网关 E2E 测试。\n\nmultipart/form-data 中 image 和 audio 二选一；不要同时传多个文件字段。",
        "operationId": "uploadSeedanceTestedMedia",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceImageUploadMultipartRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceAudioUploadMultipartRequest"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "encoding": {
                "image": {
                  "contentType": "image/png, image/jpeg"
                },
                "audio": {
                  "contentType": "audio/wav"
                }
              },
              "examples": {
                "uploadImage": {
                  "summary": "上传参考图片",
                  "description": "Apifox 中选择 form-data，字段名填 image，类型选择 File，选择 PNG/JPEG 图片。"
                },
                "uploadAudio": {
                  "summary": "上传参考音频",
                  "description": "Apifox 中选择 form-data，字段名填 audio，类型选择 File，选择 WAV 音频。"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "上传成功。复制 media_url 到生成接口中使用。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceMediaUploadResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "image": {
                    "summary": "图片上传响应",
                    "value": {
                      "upload_id": "sdupl_example_image",
                      "media_url": "https://tkcreazy.top/v1/videos/uploads/sdupl_example_image",
                      "media_type": "image",
                      "content_type": "image/png",
                      "size": 72396,
                      "sha256": "d42c2780ffcedeb699ac245f42118b4ed082e61d1ba7146549b9df08607f2731",
                      "expires_at": "2026-08-03T12:00:00Z"
                    }
                  },
                  "audio": {
                    "summary": "音频上传响应",
                    "value": {
                      "upload_id": "sdupl_example_audio",
                      "media_url": "https://tkcreazy.top/v1/videos/uploads/sdupl_example_audio",
                      "media_type": "audio",
                      "content_type": "audio/wav",
                      "size": 441044,
                      "sha256": "0f1e2d3c4b5a69788796a5b4c3d2e1f00112233445566778899aabbccddeeff",
                      "expires_at": "2026-08-03T12:00:00Z"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "413": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/PayloadTooLarge"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServiceUnavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos/generations": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Seedance 视频生成（已测）"
        ],
        "summary": "创建 Seedance 视频生成任务（已测：单图、多图、图片+音频）",
        "description": "创建异步视频生成任务，成功后返回 job_id。客户端应继续调用 GET /videos/jobs/{job_id} 查询状态；任务 completed 后调用 GET /videos/jobs/{job_id}/content 下载 MP4。\n\n本文档中的三个请求示例均已通过 TKCreazy 网关实测：\n1. 单图：使用 image_url。\n2. 多图：使用 guidances.image_reference，最多写入本轮已测的 2 张图片示例。\n3. 图片+音频：同时使用 guidances.image_reference 和 guidances.audio_reference。\n\n音频引用注意：audio_reference 必须和 image_reference 一起使用；audio_reference 项不要写 order 字段。本轮已测音频引用结果包含真实音轨，并保留参考音频的核心频率特征。\n\n已测组合：model=seedance-2.0-fast、resolution=480p、duration=5、aspect_ratio=1:1。其它模型、分辨率、时长、比例如果要写入公开文档，应先通过 TKCreazy 网关单独测试。",
        "operationId": "createSeedanceTestedVideoJob",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceSingleImageGenerationRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceMultiImageGenerationRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceImageAudioGenerationRequest"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "singleImage": {
                  "summary": "已测：单图生成",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "seedance-2.0-fast",
                    "prompt": "以参考图片中的红色购物袋营销 logo 为主体，生成一个干净的商品展示短视频，镜头轻微推进，主体保持清晰可识别。",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "resolution": "480p",
                    "aspect_ratio": "1:1",
                    "audio": false,
                    "image_url": "https://tkcreazy.top/v1/videos/uploads/sdupl_example_image"
                  }
                },
                "multiImage": {
                  "summary": "已测：多图生成",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "seedance-2.0-fast",
                    "prompt": "参考两张图片生成一个商品展示视频：一个机器人拿着购物袋，购物袋上同时体现红色营销 logo 和蓝紫色品牌标识，画面干净明亮。",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "resolution": "480p",
                    "aspect_ratio": "1:1",
                    "audio": false,
                    "guidances": {
                      "image_reference": [
                        {
                          "image": {
                            "url": "https://tkcreazy.top/v1/videos/uploads/sdupl_example_image_1",
                            "type": "UPLOADED"
                          },
                          "strength": "HIGH",
                          "order": 0
                        },
                        {
                          "image": {
                            "url": "https://tkcreazy.top/v1/videos/uploads/sdupl_example_image_2",
                            "type": "UPLOADED"
                          },
                          "strength": "HIGH",
                          "order": 1
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "imageWithAudio": {
                  "summary": "已测：图片 + 音频引用生成",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "seedance-2.0-fast",
                    "prompt": "以参考图片中的红色购物袋营销 logo 为主体，生成一个 5 秒展示视频；画面节奏参考上传的音频，主体稳定可识别。",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "resolution": "480p",
                    "aspect_ratio": "1:1",
                    "audio": true,
                    "guidances": {
                      "image_reference": [
                        {
                          "image": {
                            "url": "https://tkcreazy.top/v1/videos/uploads/sdupl_example_image",
                            "type": "UPLOADED"
                          },
                          "strength": "HIGH",
                          "order": 0
                        }
                      ],
                      "audio_reference": [
                        {
                          "audio": {
                            "url": "https://tkcreazy.top/v1/videos/uploads/sdupl_example_audio",
                            "type": "UPLOADED"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "任务已创建。继续查询任务状态。",
            "headers": {
              "Location": {
                "description": "任务状态查询地址。",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "uri"
                }
              },
              "Preference-Applied": {
                "description": "异步任务响应标记。",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "respond-async"
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceVideoJobCreateResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "job_id": "vidjob_example_123",
                  "status": "queued",
                  "status_url": "https://tkcreazy.top/v1/videos/jobs/vidjob_example_123"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServiceUnavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos/jobs/{job_id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Seedance 视频生成（已测）"
        ],
        "summary": "查询 Seedance 视频任务状态",
        "description": "使用创建任务返回的 job_id 查询状态。已通过网关测试 running 和 completed 状态。状态为 completed 后可下载 content。",
        "operationId": "getSeedanceTestedVideoJob",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/JobID"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务状态。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceVideoJob"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "running": {
                    "summary": "运行中",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "vidjob_example_123",
                      "job_id": "vidjob_example_123",
                      "status": "running"
                    }
                  },
                  "completed": {
                    "summary": "已完成",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "vidjob_example_123",
                      "job_id": "vidjob_example_123",
                      "status": "completed"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServiceUnavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos/jobs/{job_id}/content": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Seedance 视频生成（已测）"
        ],
        "summary": "下载 Seedance 视频结果 MP4",
        "description": "任务 completed 后调用。已通过网关测试返回 video/mp4，并能下载单图、多图、图片+音频三类生成结果。音频引用任务下载的 MP4 包含视频轨和音频轨；单图/多图示例因为 audio=false，仅包含视频轨。",
        "operationId": "downloadSeedanceTestedVideoJobContent",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/JobID"
          },
          {
            "name": "Range",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "description": "可选范围下载，例如 bytes=0-1023。客户端应以实际 HTTP 状态码和 Content-Range 为准。",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "bytes=0-1023"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "完整 MP4 文件。",
            "content": {
              "video/mp4": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "binary"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "206": {
            "description": "范围下载 MP4 片段。",
            "headers": {
              "Content-Range": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "bytes 0-1023/740415"
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "video/mp4": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "binary"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServiceUnavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "API Key",
        "description": "填写本站 API Key：Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_API_KEY>"
      }
    },
    "parameters": {
      "JobID": {
        "name": "job_id",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "description": "创建任务返回的 job_id。",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "vidjob_example_123"
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "SeedanceImageUploadMultipartRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "image"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "image": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "binary",
            "description": "参考图片文件。已测 image/png 和 image/jpeg。"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "SeedanceAudioUploadMultipartRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "audio"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "audio": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "binary",
            "description": "参考音频文件。已测 audio/wav。"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "SeedanceMediaUploadResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "upload_id",
          "media_url",
          "media_type",
          "content_type",
          "size",
          "sha256",
          "expires_at"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "upload_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "上传记录 ID，仅用于标识。生成接口请使用 media_url。",
            "example": "sdupl_example_image"
          },
          "media_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "可在生成接口中引用的素材 URL。复制完整值，不要改写。",
            "example": "https://tkcreazy.top/v1/videos/uploads/sdupl_example_image"
          },
          "media_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "image",
              "audio"
            ],
            "description": "本轮网关实测的素材类型。"
          },
          "content_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "image/png"
          },
          "size": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64",
            "example": 72396
          },
          "sha256": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "d42c2780ffcedeb699ac245f42118b4ed082e61d1ba7146549b9df08607f2731"
          },
          "expires_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "example": "2026-08-03T12:00:00Z"
          }
        }
      },
      "SeedanceTestedBaseGenerationFields": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "prompt",
          "duration",
          "resolution",
          "aspect_ratio",
          "audio"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "seedance-2.0-fast"
            ],
            "description": "本轮通过网关 E2E 测试的模型。"
          },
          "prompt": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "视频提示词。"
          },
          "duration": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              5
            ],
            "description": "本轮通过网关 E2E 测试的时长。"
          },
          "resolution": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "480p"
            ],
            "description": "本轮通过网关 E2E 测试的分辨率档位。"
          },
          "aspect_ratio": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "1:1"
            ],
            "description": "本轮通过网关 E2E 测试的画幅比例。"
          },
          "audio": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否生成/保留音频。单图、多图测试为 false；图片+音频引用测试为 true。"
          },
          "prompt_enhance": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "可选。本文档未对该字段做单独效果测试，默认不填写。"
          }
        }
      },
      "SeedanceSingleImageGenerationRequest": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceTestedBaseGenerationFields"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "image_url"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "audio": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "enum": [
                  false
                ]
              },
              "image_url": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uri",
                "description": "图片上传返回的完整 media_url。"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "SeedanceMultiImageGenerationRequest": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceTestedBaseGenerationFields"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "guidances"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "audio": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "enum": [
                  false
                ]
              },
              "guidances": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "image_reference"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "image_reference": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "minItems": 2,
                    "maxItems": 2,
                    "description": "本轮通过网关 E2E 测试的是 2 张参考图片。",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceImageReference"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "SeedanceImageAudioGenerationRequest": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceTestedBaseGenerationFields"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "guidances"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "audio": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "enum": [
                  true
                ]
              },
              "guidances": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "image_reference",
                  "audio_reference"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "image_reference": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "minItems": 1,
                    "maxItems": 1,
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceImageReference"
                    }
                  },
                  "audio_reference": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "minItems": 1,
                    "maxItems": 1,
                    "description": "不要填写 order 字段。",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceAudioReference"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "SeedanceImageReference": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "image"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "image": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceImageMediaRef"
          },
          "strength": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "HIGH"
            ],
            "description": "本轮实测使用 HIGH。"
          },
          "order": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "图片顺序。本轮多图实测使用 0 和 1。"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "SeedanceAudioReference": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "audio"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "audio": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceAudioMediaRef"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "SeedanceImageMediaRef": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "url",
          "type"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
